  "sourceObservations": [
    {
      "path": "scripts/verify-installed-desktop.ts",
      "observation": "launchInstalled uses stdio ignore, so main and backend startup error output is not retained. The current failure is process-exit, not the 80000ms readiness deadline."
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/desktop/main.ts",
      "observation": "The existing startup catch writes an error to stderr, stops the backend and exits 1. Current artifact does not prove that this catch rather than another native exit path caused the observed exit 1."
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/desktop/backend-policy.ts",
      "observation": "Backend readiness validates launch token, exact loopback origin and child PID. It rejects authenticated harness.error, spawn error, disconnect, exit and a 60000ms deadline. These boundaries currently do not retain a fixed structured cause in the verifier."
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/server/main.ts",
      "observation": "Existing startup catch sends authenticated harness.error with a message and exits 1. Original error codes are not retained as a fixed category across this boundary."
    },
    {
      "path": "apps/web/src/App.tsx / split-workspace-api.ts / workspace-integration.css",
      "observation": "Renderer changes add guarded initial-layout retry/error handling and rail/composer containment. A main renderer can fail before a sampling interval, so absent owned-origin observation alone cannot exclude renderer failure. No source-proven cause found in the reviewed delta."
    },
    {
      "path": "scripts/installed-native-save.ts",
      "observation": "The helper differs from 8d08 to accepted463d, but its native Save invocation occurs after main-page readiness and memory review. Current run recorded zero memory observations, so no helper native UI action was reached."
    }
  ],
